    <briefdescription>
<para>A group of file scan tasks planned as one unit of parallel work. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Groups are produced by <ref refid="classiceberg_1_1DataTableScan_1ae786a389b433e5f4106dc0853192f115" kindref="member">DataTableScan::PlanTasksStream()</ref>. The tasks in a group are read sequentially by one reader, and groups are the unit of parallelism for parallel scans. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
